    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229330/extras/7648d384007f1110d104d7f842c67dce.avif?t=1750525607\" data-has-big width=800 height=1118 /></span> Fishtank Reality TV Simulator is a First Person Business Sim that tasks the player with successfully running a reality TV show!\u00a0<br><br>Make your show a smash hit by:<br><br> 1. Manipulating the contestants and growing your audience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Planning events and buying supplies on your computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Setting out on an adventure to acquire resources and meet new friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into the director's chair!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229330/extras/7648d384007f1110d104d7f842c67dce.avif?t=1750525607\" data-has-big width=800 height=1118 /></span> Fishtank Reality TV Simulator is a First Person Business Sim that tasks the player with successfully running a reality TV show!\u00a0<br><br>Make your show a smash hit by:<br><br> 1. Manipulating the contestants and growing your audience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Planning events and buying supplies on your computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Setting out on an adventure to acquire resources and meet new friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into the director's chair!</p>",
    "short_description": "It's time to run the show! Give yourself the opportunity to direct the internet reality experience, Fishtank.live, and enjoy the chaos that comes with it!",
